      "proposed_content": "The self-adjoint prolate extension has a discrete negative spectrum with the same ultraviolet behavior as squared zeta-zero ordinates and is interpreted as capturing the archimedean contribution, but a finite RH certificate separately needs an exhaustive total-zero count and equally many critical-line witnesses.",
